    <Description>
      <One_Line_Description_Summary/>
      <Description>Provide common utilities for:
Error reporting and conversion to human readable formates.
Data type manipulation including performant data flatten and unflatten
Network helpers for workign with IPV4
Statistics and benchmark tools
Time conversions</Description>
